# Optional, public PostHog project token (never a personal API key/secret).
# Leave blank to disable telemetry. When configured, capture is automatic, without consent UI.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# Only this explicit EU ingestion origin is accepted.
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.i.posthog.com
# Before enabling: enable PostHog project "Discard client IP data" and disable
# IP-based enrichment. No identity/preferences persist across documents.
# Vite embeds these public values at build time. See README.md for limitations.
